  "version": 1,
  "about": "SW10 monument sword catalogue: which blade, guard, pommel and grip a planet sword gets. Tune weights and affinities here only. weight(entry) = entry.weight x product over entry.affinity of (1 + (m - 1) x strength(trait)), in array order, then x m for each entry.pairs [id, m] whose id was picked earlier (blade, then guard, then pommel). A weight of 0 disables an entry: it is never drawn and no other pick moves (SW12 lists window, faultbound and shear so, dormant until the owner weighs them). Trait strengths are 0..1: 'ramp' is clamp((input - from) / (to - from), 0, 1) (from > to ramps down), 'flag' is 1 when the input is true, 'archetype' is 1 when the archetype is listed; 'gate' zeroes a trait when that flag input is false. Picks use bladegen's seeded PRNG (monument/design.ts).",
